    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9ba94bd4-55ac-5bdd-9810-4822e569fa71" activityNameId="3c7b400b-3e4a-5d77-921f-397a3b6ca37e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rough asphalt MR surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rough asphalt MR surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant
Modern Swiss technologies for regional storage facilities, material extraction, and asphalt production. Based on survey data from 73 asphalt mixing plants. 
UUID: 882c971b-3790-4da6-b845-95d5fe294c4e
This dataset covers the production of average rough asphalt MR in Switzerland, with 0% reclaimed asphalt. The process represents an average MR, derived from the mean material composition of MR 8 and MR 11 layers. It includes raw material extraction, transportation, and manufacturing processes.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of hot mix rough asphalt, using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 351352456 t 
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_882c971b-3790-4da6-b845-95d5fe294c4e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
